  "answer": "Pressed once on its text, a new Text shows the block toolbar, Write at 108.1, 242.2 to Remove at 314.1, 36 high. Pressed again with a plain click, the editor opens: the text bar's Squarespace AI at 104.1, 243.2 to Clear Formatting at 824.2, and no block toolbar button on top. In a screenshot, above and below the text bar the pixels where the toolbar sat (x 150, 250, 340) equal those at x 600 and 850, where none can be: the page's purple and the bar's own shadow, no edge.",
